{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class GregAndFriends {\n    static final long MOD = 1000000007L;\n    static int n, k, cnt50 = 0, cnt100 = 0;\n    static long[][] comb = new long[100][100];\n\n    static class Item implements Comparable<Item> {\n        int mask;\n        int d;\n        Item(int m, int d) {\n            mask = m;\n            d = d;\n        }\n        public int compareTo(Item o) {\n            return Integer.compare(this.d, o.d);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        k = sc.nextInt();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            if (sc.nextInt() == 50) cnt50++;\n            else cnt100++;\n        }\n        sc.close();\n\n        precomputeCombinations();\n\n        int start = 1000000 + 100 * cnt50 + cnt100;\n        Map<Integer, Integer> dist = new HashMap<Integer, Integer>();\n        Map<Integer, Long> ways = new HashMap<Integer, Long>();\n        PriorityQueue<Item> pq = new PriorityQueue<Item>();\n\n        dist.put(start, 0);\n        ways.put(start, 1L);\n        pq.add(new Item(start, 0));\n\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n            Item cur = pq.poll();\n            if (cur.d != dist.get(cur.mask)) continue;\n            expand(cur.mask, dist, ways, pq);\n        }\n\n        if (dist.containsKey(0)) {\n            System.out.println(dist.get(0) + \"\\n\" + ways.get(0));\n        } else {\n            System.out.println(\"-1\\n0\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void expand(int mask, Map<Integer, Integer> dist, Map<Integer, Long> ways, PriorityQueue<Item> pq) {\n        int boat = mask / 1000000;\n        int left50 = (mask % 1000000) / 100;\n        int left100 = mask % 100;\n\n        if (boat > 0) {\n            for (int i = left50; i >= 0 && 50 * (left50 - i) <= k; i--) {\n                for (int j = left100; j >= 0 && 50 * (left50 - i) + 100 * (left100 - j) <= k; j--) {\n                    if (i != left50 || j != left100) {\n                        long edge = comb[left50][i] * comb[left100][j] % MOD;\n                        relax(mask, i * 100 + j, edge, dist, ways, pq);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        } else {\n            for (int i = left50; i <= cnt50 && 50 * (i - left50) <= k; i++) {\n                for (int j = left100; j <= cnt100 && 50 * (i - left50) + 100 * (j - left100) <= k; j++) {\n                    if (i != left50 || j != left100) {\n                        long edge = comb[cnt50 - left50][i - left50] * comb[cnt100 - left100][j - left100] % MOD;\n                        relax(mask, 1000000 + i * 100 + j, edge, dist, ways, pq);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void relax(int fromMask, int toMask, long edge, Map<Integer, Integer> dist, Map<Integer, Long> ways, PriorityQueue<Item> pq) {\n        int nd = dist.get(fromMask) + 1;\n        Integer old = dist.get(toMask);\n        if (old == null || nd < old) {\n            dist.put(toMask, nd);\n            ways.put(toMask, ways.get(fromMask) * edge % MOD);\n            pq.add(new Item(toMask, nd));\n        } else if (nd == old) {\n            ways.put(toMask, (ways.get(toMask) + ways.get(fromMask) * edge) % MOD);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void precomputeCombinations() {\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n            comb[i][0] = 1;\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++) {\n                comb[i][j] = (comb[i - 1][j - 1] + comb[i - 1][j]) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nimport heapq\n\nMOD = 1000000007\n\ndef precompute_combinations():\n    comb = [[0] * 100 for _ in range(100)]\n    for i in range(100):\n        comb[i][0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, 100):\n        for j in range(1, i + 1):\n            comb[i][j] = (comb[i-1][j-1] + comb[i-1][j]) % MOD\n    return comb\n\ndef expand(mask, dist, ways, pq, comb, cnt50, cnt100, k):\n    boat = mask // 1000000\n    left50 = (mask % 1000000) // 100\n    left100 = mask % 100\n\n    if boat > 0:\n        # boat on left side, move people to right\n        for i in range(left50, -1, -1):\n            if 50 * (left50 - i) > k:\n                break\n            for j in range(left100, -1, -1):\n                if 50 * (left50 - i) + 100 * (left100 - j) > k:\n                    break\n                if i == left50 and j == left100:\n                    continue\n                edge = comb[left50][i] * comb[left100][j] % MOD\n                to_mask = i * 100 + j  # boat goes to right side (boat=0)\n                relax(mask, to_mask, edge, dist, ways, pq)\n    else:\n        # boat on right side, move people to left\n        for i in range(left50, cnt50 + 1):\n            if 50 * (i - left50) > k:\n                break\n            for j in range(left100, cnt100 + 1):\n                if 50 * (i - left50) + 100 * (j - left100) > k:\n                    break\n                if i == left50 and j == left100:\n                    continue\n                edge = comb[cnt50 - left50][i - left50] * comb[cnt100 - left100][j - left100] % MOD\n                to_mask = 1000000 + i * 100 + j  # boat goes to left side (boat=1)\n                relax(mask, to_mask, edge, dist, ways, pq)\n\ndef relax(from_mask, to_mask, edge, dist, ways, pq):\n    nd = dist[from_mask] + 1\n    old = dist.get(to_mask)\n    if old is None or nd < old:\n        dist[to_mask] = nd\n        ways[to_mask] = ways[from_mask] * edge % MOD\n        heapq.heappush(pq, (nd, to_mask))\n    elif nd == old:\n        ways[to_mask] = (ways[to_mask] + ways[from_mask] * edge) % MOD\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    n = int(next(it))\n    k = int(next(it))\n    cnt50 = 0\n    cnt100 = 0\n    for _ in range(n):\n        w = int(next(it))\n        if w == 50:\n            cnt50 += 1\n        else:\n            cnt100 += 1\n\n    comb = precompute_combinations()\n\n    start = 1000000 + 100 * cnt50 + cnt100\n    dist = {start: 0}\n    ways = {start: 1}\n    pq = [(0, start)]\n\n    while pq:\n        d, mask = heapq.heappop(pq)\n        if d != dist.get(mask):\n            continue\n        expand(mask, dist, ways, pq, comb, cnt50, cnt100, k)\n\n    if 0 in dist:\n        print(dist[0])\n        print(ways[0])\n    else:\n        print(\"-1\")\n        print(\"0\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.235741941258311e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -8.666139910928905e-05, -0.000924993772059679, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -0.003184844274073839, -2.396077979938127e-05, -1.0847986231965479e-05, -5.9126061387360096e-05, -9.60780744208023e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.8967437174287625e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.1272263079881668, -0.001490